content:
# Sprint Report

**Sprint:** {{ parameters.sprint_name }}  
**Generated:** {{ timestamp | format_date 'yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss UTC' }}  
**Total Items:** {{ items | size }}

## Sprint Summary

{{~ completed_items = items | where 'state == "Done" || state == "Closed"' ~}}
{{~ in_progress_items = items | where 'state == "Active" || state == "In Progress"' ~}}
{{~ new_items = items | where 'state == "New" || state == "To Do"' ~}}

- **Completed:** {{ completed_items | size }} items
- **In Progress:** {{ in_progress_items | size }} items
- **Not Started:** {{ new_items | size }} items

## Completed Work

{{~ if (completed_items | size) > 0 ~}}
| ID | Title | Type | Assignee |
|----|-------|------|----------|
{{~ for item in completed_items ~}}
| [{{ item.id }}]({{ item.url }}) | {{ item.title }} | {{ item.work_item_type }} | {{ item.assigned_to }} |
{{~ end ~}}
{{~ else ~}}
No items completed in this sprint.
{{~ end ~}}

## Work in Progress

{{~ if (in_progress_items | size) > 0 ~}}
| ID | Title | Type | Assignee | State |
|----|-------|------|----------|-------|
{{~ for item in in_progress_items ~}}
| [{{ item.id }}]({{ item.url }}) | {{ item.title }} | {{ item.work_item_type }} | {{ item.assigned_to }} | {{ item.state }} |
{{~ end ~}}
{{~ else ~}}
No items in progress.
{{~ end ~}}

## Remaining Work

{{~ if (new_items | size) > 0 ~}}
| ID | Title | Type | Priority |
|----|-------|------|----------|
{{~ for item in new_items ~}}
| [{{ item.id }}]({{ item.url }}) | {{ item.title }} | {{ item.work_item_type }} | {{ item.priority }} |
{{~ end ~}}
{{~ else ~}}
No remaining items.
{{~ end ~}}

## Metrics

{{~ total_items = items | size ~}}
{{~ completed_count = completed_items | size ~}}
{{~ completion_rate = (completed_count / total_items) * 100 ~}}

- **Sprint Velocity:** {{ completed_count }} items
- **Completion Rate:** {{ completion_rate | format_number '#0' }}%
- **Average Days to Complete:** {{ parameters.avg_completion_days | format_number '#0.0' }} days

## Next Steps

{{~ if (in_progress_items | size) > 0 ~}}
1. Focus on completing {{ in_progress_items | size }} in-progress items
{{~ end ~}}
{{~ if (new_items | size) > 0 ~}}
2. Prioritize {{ new_items | size }} remaining items for next sprint
{{~ end ~}}
3. Review sprint metrics and adjust planning for future sprints

---

